    "notes": "<p>Code is MIT licensed; third-party data retain their source terms. Measured MeerKAT beam data are CC BY-NC 4.0 and used for research only. Raw SpaceX ephemerides and ESA Kelvins inputs are not redistributed. The release provides the paper PDF, canonical evidence object, claims manifest, complete tables and publication-contract tests. The original GitHub tag archive is preserved. The standalone paper-2026-09-v2.pdf is the final DOI-bearing paper; paper-v2-doi-materials.zip supplies the matching evidence, claims and source metadata from commit 5f220be9e6d47d1caaa3cb6c9180ab32323a22ba. Scientific results are unchanged from the tagged release.</p>"
